tually the subspace $\\text{Span}{v,w}.$ \nHence, we have \n\n$$\nA=[\\begin{aligned}1 & -1 \\\\ 1 & 1 \\\\ 1 & -1\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{P}_{S} & =A({A}^{T}\\,A)^{-1}\\,{A}^{T} \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}1 & -1 \\\\ 1 & 1 \\\\ 1 & -1\\end{aligned}]{([\\begin{aligned}1 & 1 & 1 \\\\ -1 & 1 & -1\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}1 & -1 \\\\ 1 & 1 \\\\ 1 & -1\\end{aligned}])}^{-1}[\\begin{aligned}1 & 1 & 1 \\\\ -1 & 1 & -1\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}1 & -1 \\\\ 1 & 1 \\\\ 1 & -1\\end{aligned}]{[\\begin{aligned}3 & -1 \\\\ -1 & 3\\end{aligned}]}^{-1}[\\begin{aligned}1 & 1 & 1 \\\\ -1 & 1 & -1\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{8}[\\begin{aligned}1 & -1 \\\\ 1 & 1 \\\\ 1 & -1\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}3 & 1 \\\\ 1 & 3\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}1 & 1 & 1 \\\\ -1 & 1 & -1\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{8}[\\begin{aligned}1 & -1 \\\\ 1 & 1 \\\\ 1 & -1\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}2 & 4 & 2 \\\\ -2 & 4 & -2\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}[\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 2 & 0 \\\\ 1 & 0 & 1\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14071876/state.json" "file_sha256" "108b1a9ca25123f1278ca81da88a7f6facc0968a6f4d38514449d4ecd01b580b"} {"question" "q-40647" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/moderate "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14071876/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "b7c5f82bb3d73c9bbdb55aaeefc59d06b9e7acab459dff5b850a4571c1656032"} {"question" "q-40647" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14071876/state.json" "file_sha256" "108b1a9ca25123f1278ca81da88a7f6facc0968a6f4d38514449d4ecd01b580b"} {"